  "classIri": "urn:ngm:class:optimism-collective",
  "domain": "blockchain",
  "definition": "The Optimism Collective is a two-house governance body overseeing the Optimism ecosystem \u2014 a suite of Ethereum Layer 2 networks built on the OP Stack rollup technology \u2014 consisting of the Token House (OP token holders who vote on protocol upgrades and treasury allocations) and the Citizens' House (non-transferable badge holders who allocate Retroactive Public Goods Funding). It represents one of the most sophisticated real-world experiments in bicameral on-chain governance, designed to balance token-weighted economic interests with broader societal value creation and public goods provision.",
